<title>USA: Canon-McMillan SD, Pa., won by Mellon Bank.</title>
<headline>Canon-McMillan SD, Pa., won by Mellon Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mellon Bank said it won $5 million of Canon-McMillan School District, Pa., general obligation bonds, Series of 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.372 percent without insurance recalculation.</p>
</text>
